    "status": "present",
    "value": "Permissions are given as triples [entity, relationship, object] using four relationships: a user owns a camera (cameraOwner), a user belongs to a group (groupMember), a group is a member of a parent group so that its members also count as members of the parent (subgroupMember), and a group owns a camera (groupCameraOwner). A user administers a camera if they own it directly or belong, through any chain of group memberships, to a group that owns it. Given a camera id, return all its administrators sorted. Group membership may contain cycles."
  },
